        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cher, Brian Higgins\n- Songs: Cher's 1998 number-one single, \"You Better Sit Down Kids\"\n- Albums: the album containing the 1998 single, the 2005 Cher compilation album\n\nFacts:\n- Brian Higgins wrote Cher's 1998 number-one single \"Believe.\"\n- Cher released \"Believe\" as a number-one single in 1998.\n- Cher included \"Believe\" on the 1998 album \"Believe.\"\n- Cher released the compilation album \"Gold\" in 2005.\n- Cher's 2005 compilation album \"Gold\" included the song \"You Better Sit Down Kids.\"\n- The album that included \"Believe\" was released two years before Cher's 2005 compilation album \"Gold.\"",
